    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$ink"
      text: "<b>Nuclear Bottleneck Takeaway:</b> Without closed-loop breeding (TBR ≥ 1.05) proven on physical hardware, the DT fusion industry cannot fuel beyond 2–3 pilot plants."

